{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"id": "t", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 20, "width": 1000, "height": 40.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 76761056, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 81278708, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "HireTrack Core \u2014 Non-Functional Requirements (mechanism-backed)", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HireTrack Core \u2014 Non-Functional Requirements (mechanism-backed)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "s", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 55, "width": 1000, "height": 26.900000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 95882064, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 81199537, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Each NFR states the quality AND how the core app enforces it. Boxes sized to content.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Each NFR states the quality AND how the core app enforces it. Boxes sized to content.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "n0-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 100, "width": 600, "height": 158.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 20176364, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 71496434, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "n0-t", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 114, "width": 572, "height": 130.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 777536, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 10264055, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SECURITY & TENANCY\nNFR-S1 Org isolation \u2014 organizationId on models/queries (candidates, jobs, history, \u2026)\nNFR-S2 AuthN \u2014 JWT cookies; refresh; OTP 2FA; Google/Microsoft OAuth routes\nNFR-S3 AuthZ \u2014 middleware role gates (interviewer page/API denylist; admin backups)\nNFR-S4 Least privilege \u2014 interviewer field projections; private custom-field filters\nNFR-S5 Session hygiene \u2014 logout/refresh; encrypted cookie helpers\nNFR-S6 Integration secrets \u2014 stored in org settings/env; not hardcoded in client", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "SECURITY & TENANCY\nNFR-S1 Org isolation \u2014 organizationId on models/queries (candidates, jobs, history, \u2026)\nNFR-S2 AuthN \u2014 JWT cookies; refresh; OTP 2FA; Google/Microsoft OAuth routes\nNFR-S3 AuthZ \u2014 middleware role gates (interviewer page/API denylist; admin backups)\nNFR-S4 Least privilege \u2014 interviewer field projections; private custom-field filters\nNFR-S5 Session hygiene \u2014 logout/refresh; encrypted cookie helpers\nNFR-S6 Integration secrets \u2014 stored in org settings/env; not hardcoded in client", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "n1-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 656, "y": 100, "width": 600, "height": 158.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 36761803, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 61728102, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "n1-t", "type": "text", "x": 670, "y": 114, "width": 572, "height": 130.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 21654072, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 33599686, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PERFORMANCE & SCALE\nNFR-P1 Candidate growth \u2014 lane counts + paginated/lazy lane loads (jobs/[id]/candidates)\nNFR-P2 Indexes \u2014 org+status+createdAt (+ analytics setup-indexes)\nNFR-P3 Lean/projection queries on hot candidate/job APIs\nNFR-P4 Client efficiency \u2014 RTK Query caching; avoid refetch storms\nNFR-P5 Heavy work \u2014 process-cv batches, bulk-ai, OCR sidecar; not blocking UI thread forever\nNFR-P6 Analytics cost \u2014 dedicated aggregation routes + optional rate limits", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "PERFORMANCE & SCALE\nNFR-P1 Candidate growth \u2014 lane counts + paginated/lazy lane loads (jobs/[id]/candidates)\nNFR-P2 Indexes \u2014 org+status+createdAt (+ analytics setup-indexes)\nNFR-P3 Lean/projection queries on hot candidate/job APIs\nNFR-P4 Client efficiency \u2014 RTK Query caching; avoid refetch storms\nNFR-P5 Heavy work \u2014 process-cv batches, bulk-ai, OCR sidecar; not blocking UI thread forever\nNFR-P6 Analytics cost \u2014 dedicated aggregation routes + optional rate limits", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "n2-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 276.85, "width": 600, "height": 158.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 86111549, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 54490122, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "n2-t", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 290.85, "width": 572, "height": 130.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 13524837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 21790149, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "REALTIME & CONSISTENCY\nNFR-R1 Live Kanban \u2014 server-ws.cjs WebSocket; org-scoped client registry\nNFR-R2 Fallback \u2014 SSE-compatible broadcast path\nNFR-R3 Payload integrity \u2014 normalize checklist/history maps before broadcast\nNFR-R4 Fan-out triggers \u2014 status, assign, bulk update, remarks \u2192 peers update\nNFR-R5 Liveness \u2014 ~20s heartbeat; drop dead sockets\nNFR-R6 Calendar webhooks \u2014 google-calendar/webhook for external event sync", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "REALTIME & CONSISTENCY\nNFR-R1 Live Kanban \u2014 server-ws.cjs WebSocket; org-scoped client registry\nNFR-R2 Fallback \u2014 SSE-compatible broadcast path\nNFR-R3 Payload integrity \u2014 normalize checklist/history maps before broadcast\nNFR-R4 Fan-out triggers \u2014 status, assign, bulk update, remarks \u2192 peers update\nNFR-R5 Liveness \u2014 ~20s heartbeat; drop dead sockets\nNFR-R6 Calendar webhooks \u2014 google-calendar/webhook for external event sync", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "n3-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 656, "y": 276.85, "width": 600, "height": 158.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 88893405, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 57036911, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "n3-t", "type": "text", "x": 670, "y": 290.85, "width": 572, "height": 130.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 66234228, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 80544958, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "RELIABILITY & OPS (in-app)\nNFR-O1 Process model \u2014 production entry server-ws.cjs (Next + WS)\nNFR-O2 Observability \u2014 logger; optional Sentry when DSN set; logs/nginx/pm2 APIs for ops UI\nNFR-O3 Backups \u2014 /api/backups \u00b7 db/take-snapshot\nNFR-O4 Health/util \u2014 disk-space \u00b7 test-connection \u00b7 version/list\nNFR-O5 Reminders durability \u2014 cron/reminders + status + replay; followup-reminders\nNFR-O6 CV resilience \u2014 process-pending \u00b7 retry-failed batches", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "RELIABILITY & OPS (in-app)\nNFR-O1 Process model \u2014 production entry server-ws.cjs (Next + WS)\nNFR-O2 Observability \u2014 logger; optional Sentry when DSN set; logs/nginx/pm2 APIs for ops UI\nNFR-O3 Backups \u2014 /api/backups \u00b7 db/take-snapshot\nNFR-O4 Health/util \u2014 disk-space \u00b7 test-connection \u00b7 version/list\nNFR-O5 Reminders durability \u2014 cron/reminders + status + replay; followup-reminders\nNFR-O6 CV resilience \u2014 process-pending \u00b7 retry-failed batches", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "n4-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 453.70000000000005, "width": 600, "height": 158.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 51012928, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 53132798, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "n4-t", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 467.70000000000005, "width": 572, "height": 130.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 59238965, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 80682389, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "USABILITY & PRODUCT QUALITY\nNFR-U1 Role-appropriate UX \u2014 dashboard vs apply-jobs vs interviewer restrictions\nNFR-U2 Branding \u2014 settings/portal; metadata/favicon per org\nNFR-U3 Onboarding \u2014 onboarding/status \u00b7 validate; guided settings\nNFR-U4 Audit trail \u2014 History model for status/checklist/assignment changes\nNFR-U5 Configurability \u2014 SMTP/FS/AI/calendar/Zoom/Teams/captcha/2FA/templates\nNFR-U6 Notifications UX \u2014 unread count; mark read; mark-all-read", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "USABILITY & PRODUCT QUALITY\nNFR-U1 Role-appropriate UX \u2014 dashboard vs apply-jobs vs interviewer restrictions\nNFR-U2 Branding \u2014 settings/portal; metadata/favicon per org\nNFR-U3 Onboarding \u2014 onboarding/status \u00b7 validate; guided settings\nNFR-U4 Audit trail \u2014 History model for status/checklist/assignment changes\nNFR-U5 Configurability \u2014 SMTP/FS/AI/calendar/Zoom/Teams/captcha/2FA/templates\nNFR-U6 Notifications UX \u2014 unread count; mark read; mark-all-read", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "n5-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 656, "y": 453.70000000000005, "width": 600, "height": 158.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 54153467, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 22035960, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "n5-t", "type": "text", "x": 670, "y": 467.70000000000005, "width": 572, "height": 130.85000000000002, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 92331382, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 22609141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "RUNTIME QUALITY STACK\nBrowser (dashboard + WS)\n    \u2192 AuthN/Z (S*) \u2192 server-ws + App Router API\n         \u2192 MongoDB indexed (P*)\n         \u2192 Files (local/S3/Cloudinary)\n         \u2192 Gemini / mail / Google\u00b7Teams\u00b7Zoom\nTrace to FR: Kanban\u2194P1+R1 \u00b7 RBAC\u2194S3 \u00b7 AI\u2194P5 \u00b7 Realtime\u2194R* \u00b7 History\u2194U4", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "RUNTIME QUALITY STACK\nBrowser (dashboard + WS)\n    \u2192 AuthN/Z (S*) \u2192 server-ws + App Router API\n         \u2192 MongoDB indexed (P*)\n         \u2192 Files (local/S3/Cloudinary)\n         \u2192 Gemini / mail / Google\u00b7Teams\u00b7Zoom\nTrace to FR: Kanban\u2194P1+R1 \u00b7 RBAC\u2194S3 \u00b7 AI\u2194P5 \u00b7 Realtime\u2194R* \u00b7 History\u2194U4", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "note-r", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 636.5500000000001, "width": 1200, "height": 71.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 42505757, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30860220, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "note-t", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 650.5500000000001, "width": 1172, "height": 43.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 53879046, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 16108432, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Scope\nCore app NFRs only. License server and CI/release pipeline are separate projects.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Scope\nCore app NFRs only. License server and CI/release pipeline are separate projects.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#f8f9fa"}, "files": {}}